# MemTether Memory Rules

When this project uses MemTether (MCP server "memtether" connected):
- User says "remember this" → call add_memories (source="cursor")
- User asks about past context → search_memory FIRST before answering
- First sentence of content = the key conclusion (projection keeps only that)

Slash-style requests:
- "/mem-search <query>" → search_memory(query)
- "/mem-remember <fact>" → add_memories(content, source="cursor", type="fact")
